              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 26:41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bali sisi tulimwomba dua Mungu wetu, tena tukaweka walinzi, mchana na usiku, kwa sababu yao, ili kuwapinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Yuda wakasema, Nguvu zao wapagazi zimedhoofika, bado kuna vifusi tele; hatuwezi kuujenga ukuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao adui zetu wakasema, Hawatajua wala kuona, hadi tutakapokuja kati yao, na kuwaua, na kuikomesha kazi hiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Wayahudi waliokaa karibu nao, walikuja, wakatuambia mara kumi: Watakuja kutoka kila sehemu wanapokaa kutushambulia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Katika Kiebrania mstari huu unatatanisha, unasema, ‘kila mahali mtakaporejea’ badala ya ‘wanapokaa’.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
