                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " basi mahali popote mtakaposikia sauti ya baragumu, kimbilieni kwetu; Mungu wetu atatupigania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo tukajitia katika kazi hiyo; na nusu yao waliishika mikuki, tangu alfajiri hadi nyota zikatokea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadhalika, wakati ule ule, nikawaambia watu, Kila mtu na akae ndani ya Yerusalemu pamoja na mtumishi wake, wapate kuwa walinzi wetu wakati wa usiku, na kufanya kazi wakati wa mchana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi mimi, na ndugu zangu, na watumishi wangu, na walinzi waliofuatana nami,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:23",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tafsiri nyingine husema, ‘kila mmoja wetu daima alikuwa na silaha yake mkononi’.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " hatukuvua nguo zetu hata mmoja; kila mtu alikwenda kuteka maji akichukua silaha yake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
